From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alexander Sack <asac@pantacor.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Jan 2026 13:15:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add set_container_type() API for Pantavisor

Add API to override the container= environment variable that LXC sets
for PID 1 inside containers. This allows Pantavisor to identify
container types using custom values like "pv-mygroup" instead of "lxc".

Changes:
- Add char *type field to struct lxc_conf
- Add set_container_type() function to lxc_container API
- Use conf->type in start.c instead of hardcoded "lxc"
---
